WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:05.000
Our heroes are back on the road to Anistar City,

2
00:00:05.066 --> 00:00:07.533
as Ash dreams of winning his next Gym Badge

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.966
and getting closer to entering the Kalos League.

4
00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:14.566
- The sun's almost setting, huh?
- Pikachu.

5
00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:18.733
Camping! I know! Let's play Pokémon impressions again!

6
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.966
Good idea! Though I sure wish I could have taken a shower today.

7
00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:27.900
- It looks like rain.

8
00:00:30.433 --> 00:00:32.166
Oh, there's a hotel nearby!

9
00:00:32.233 --> 00:00:35.566
Great! Let's hurry so we don't get wet!

10
00:00:39.133 --> 00:00:43.633
Icky! It's so cold!

11
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.633
- We're here!
- Thank goodness!

12
00:00:48.733 --> 00:00:50.633
- Pika?
- Hey, what's this?

13
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:54.633
- This... is a hotel, right?
- Pika...

14
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.900
I wonder if they're open for business.

15
00:00:56.966 --> 00:00:59.133
- They sure can't clean.
- Bonnie!

16
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.466
Great! Someone's here!

17
00:01:01.533 --> 00:01:04.200
Excuse me. We'd like a room for tonight, please.

18
00:01:04.266 --> 00:01:07.433
Oh, customers. Welcome.

19
00:01:07.500 --> 00:01:11.333
Of course. I'll take you to your room.

20
00:01:12.333 --> 00:01:14.733
Now, if you'll just follow me.

21
00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.366
- Rotom?
- Rotom?

22
00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:22.333
Oh, don't worry. It was nothing.

23
00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:24.966
- Hm?
- What's this?

24
00:01:25.033 --> 00:01:30.233
Oh. That? It's a picture of the day this hotel opened.

25
00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:31.466
Oh, wow.

26
00:01:31.533 --> 00:01:34.400
Now, let's get you to your room.

27
00:01:37.366 --> 00:01:40.433
There. Good night.

28
00:01:41.966 --> 00:01:43.433
Ah!

29
00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.633
- Denne-ne!
- Whoa!

30
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:49.333
Hey, guys, wanna have a Pokémon battle?

31
00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:52.366
- Huh? Where, Ash?
- It's pouring outside.

32
00:01:52.433 --> 00:01:54.133
- Remember that picture?

33
00:01:54.200 --> 00:01:56.033
They've got a battlefield!

34
00:01:57.300 --> 00:02:00.866
- You're right, they do!
- Then let's go look for it!

35
00:02:00.933 --> 00:02:02.266
- Yeah!
- Pika!

36
00:02:02.333 --> 00:02:05.033
Let's see... Found it!

37
00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:06.600
It's down there.

38
00:02:06.666 --> 00:02:08.066
At the end of this very hall!

39
00:02:08.133 --> 00:02:09.533
- Go! Yay!
- Denne, denne.

40
00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:11.900
- Hurry! Hurry!

41
00:02:11.966 --> 00:02:13.500
Settle down, Bonnie!

42
00:02:17.233 --> 00:02:20.066
- All right!
- Pikachu!

43
00:02:20.133 --> 00:02:21.933
- Huh?
- Pika?

44
00:02:23.166 --> 00:02:24.933
It's so dirty!

45
00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:26.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

46
00:02:26.866 --> 00:02:28.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

47
00:02:28.633 --> 00:02:32.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

48
00:02:32.066 --> 00:02:33.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

49
00:02:33.533 --> 00:02:37.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

50
00:02:37.366 --> 00:02:40.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

51
00:02:40.633 --> 00:02:44.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

52
00:02:44.066 --> 00:02:47.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

53
00:02:48.033 --> 00:02:52.666
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

54
00:02:52.733 --> 00:02:54.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

55
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.333
Rotom's Wish!

56
00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:08.033
- They're having a battle!

57
00:03:14.300 --> 00:03:16.900
- Pangoro, use Tackle!
- Pangoro!

58
00:03:16.966 --> 00:03:20.666
- Krookodile, use Dig!
- Krookodile! Krook, krook, krook, krook!

59
00:03:20.733 --> 00:03:22.433
Krook, krook, krook!

60
00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:24.400
Pan...

61
00:03:24.466 --> 00:03:26.133
- Krook!
- Use Hammer Arm!

62
00:03:27.333 --> 00:03:28.866
Pangoro!

63
00:03:28.933 --> 00:03:31.766
- Use Mud-Slap!
- Krook!

64
00:03:31.833 --> 00:03:34.600
- Goro, pan!
- Odile!

65
00:03:34.666 --> 00:03:37.966
Goro!

66
00:03:38.033 --> 00:03:40.600
- Hyper Beam!
- Krookodile!

67
00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.333
- Goro...
- Pangoro is unable to battle!

68
00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.566
- Krookodile is the winner!
- Krooko!

69
00:03:48.633 --> 00:03:53.066
And that means the victor is Mantle, the hotel owner!

70
00:03:53.133 --> 00:03:56.733
Pangoro, return!

71
00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:59.433
Huh? Huh?

72
00:03:59.500 --> 00:04:02.166
As per our deal, I'll take your Pangoro.

73
00:04:02.233 --> 00:04:04.900
- Huh?
- Hold on! Not that!

74
00:04:04.966 --> 00:04:08.800
You don't like it? Then blame yourself for being weak.

75
00:04:08.866 --> 00:04:12.533
I beg of you! Pangoro's been my partner for 20 years!

76
00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.800
- All right, this battle's over!
- Come on. Hurry up!

77
00:04:15.866 --> 00:04:20.800
Give me back my Pangoro, please!

78
00:04:20.866 --> 00:04:23.900
- They had a bet on a battle.
- That's not right!

79
00:04:23.966 --> 00:04:24.800
Ash, wait!

80
00:04:24.866 --> 00:04:27.266
Hold on a minute! You can't do that!

81
00:04:27.333 --> 00:04:30.266
- Give his Pokémon back now!
- Who is this guy?

82
00:04:30.333 --> 00:04:35.133
Look, kid. The deal is, whoever loses has to give their Pokémon to the winner.

83
00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:40.333
- Come on! Doing that is wrong!
- Maybe. But a promise is a promise.

84
00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.066
- Now let's talk... Pikachu!
- Pika?

85
00:04:43.133 --> 00:04:46.600
So. Here's the deal. I'll have a battle with you.

86
00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:50.500
If you beat me, then I'll give that trainer his Pangoro back.

87
00:04:50.566 --> 00:04:53.100
Of course, if you lose...

88
00:04:53.166 --> 00:04:54.366
- Your Pikachu's mine!
- Pika!

89
00:04:54.433 --> 00:04:56.566
No way am I doing that!

90
00:04:56.633 --> 00:04:59.666
You scared? Not like you have a choice, kid!

91
00:04:59.733 --> 00:05:02.166
Yeah, kid! Prepare for battle! -Pika!

92
00:05:02.233 --> 00:05:06.366
This is awful! They're going to force you to have a battle!

93
00:05:06.433 --> 00:05:07.266
Oh, no, Ash!

94
00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.966
-Pika!

95
00:05:14.033 --> 00:05:15.633
Why, you...

96
00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.733
-It's a Rotom!

97
00:05:17.800 --> 00:05:21.000
- Rotom wants us to follow it!
- Let's go!

98
00:05:21.066 --> 00:05:22.200
- All right!
- Pika!

99
00:05:22.266 --> 00:05:25.100
- Rotom, Rotom!
- Hurry up, Clemont!

100
00:05:25.166 --> 00:05:27.966
After them, right now!

101
00:05:29.033 --> 00:05:32.766
Gah! Those kids are quick. Where did they run off to?

102
00:05:38.500 --> 00:05:41.100
- Ash?
- We're safe now.

103
00:05:41.166 --> 00:05:43.600
Thanks, Rotom. You really helped us out!

104
00:05:46.400 --> 00:05:48.833
- Pika?
- I wonder what Rotom is saying.

105
00:05:48.900 --> 00:05:51.466
I sure wish we could understand it!

106
00:05:51.533 --> 00:05:53.933
- Nenne...
- Rotom! Rotom, Rotom!

107
00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:55.866
Rotom!

108
00:05:55.933 --> 00:05:58.333
Rotom!

109
00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:02.400
Rotom!

110
00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:05.600
- It just turned on!
- Did Rotom do that?

111
00:06:05.666 --> 00:06:07.600
- Pika!
- I know.

112
00:06:07.666 --> 00:06:09.900
Maybe Rotom's trying to show us something.

113
00:06:12.466 --> 00:06:15.433
Welcome! And thank you all so very much

114
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.466
for coming to our hotel's grand opening ceremony.

115
00:06:18.533 --> 00:06:19.900
Rotom!

116
00:06:19.966 --> 00:06:21.633
Look! It's Rotom!

117
00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:25.133
So Rotom must be that man's partner.

118
00:06:25.200 --> 00:06:29.133
I'm Weston, the hotel owner. If you'll look here, please.

119
00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:32.266
My hotel battlefield is open to the public,

120
00:06:32.333 --> 00:06:36.133
so feel free to enjoy it as you engage in your Pokémon battles.

121
00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:41.600
Owner, huh? Who is he? I've seen him before.

122
00:06:41.666 --> 00:06:44.166
I know! That's the man from the front desk!

123
00:06:44.233 --> 00:06:48.666
- Yeah. I think she's right!
- That's weird. So he was the owner?

124
00:06:48.733 --> 00:06:53.433
And now he's the desk clerk? That doesn't make sense. What's going on?

125
00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:55.400
- Huh?
- Pika?

126
00:06:55.466 --> 00:06:56.633
Huh?

127
00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.166
- It's that bad guy!
- Pika!

128
00:06:58.233 --> 00:07:01.900
- I bid you welcome.
- Real nice hotel you've got here.

129
00:07:01.966 --> 00:07:05.533
So if it's open to the general public, let's have a Pokémon battle.

130
00:07:05.600 --> 00:07:07.966
And the winner gets ownership of this place.

131
00:07:08.033 --> 00:07:10.700
I wish you wouldn't joke like that.

132
00:07:10.766 --> 00:07:12.800
Wait. You think he's joking?

133
00:07:12.866 --> 00:07:15.400
Look, when Mantle says something, he means it!

134
00:07:15.466 --> 00:07:17.766
Now, now, now. Listen.

135
00:07:17.833 --> 00:07:20.933
You just told us we're free to engage in Pokémon battles.

136
00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.933
- Was that some sort of lie?
- No, of course not.

137
00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.233
If you're not going to battle me,

138
00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.800
I'll just battle your guests and take all of their Pokémon instead.

139
00:07:30.866 --> 00:07:33.400
Please don't cause any trouble for my guests!

140
00:07:33.466 --> 00:07:36.633
Well, OK. Then I'll battle you and your Rotom.

141
00:07:36.700 --> 00:07:40.366
Or is your Rotom nothing but a little coward?

142
00:07:40.433 --> 00:07:42.966
Or are you nothing but a little coward?

143
00:07:43.033 --> 00:07:44.966
What?

144
00:07:45.033 --> 00:07:46.800
Rotom! Rotom, Rotom!

145
00:07:48.033 --> 00:07:51.733
So if I win, you'll leave my guests alone and go.

146
00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:54.700
- Is it a deal?
- Yeah. It's a deal.

147
00:07:54.766 --> 00:07:56.466
Krookodile, out here!

148
00:07:59.966 --> 00:08:01.566
Krooko!

149
00:08:01.633 --> 00:08:03.566
Dile!

150
00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.333
Rotom! Rotom! Where did you go?

151
00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:11.433
- It flew away. Just like a little coward.
- Huh? Huh?

152
00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:14.566
-Looks like I win.

153
00:08:14.633 --> 00:08:16.666
It's a win by forfeit.

154
00:08:17.666 --> 00:08:20.866
- That's what happened!
- That's why the owner changed.

155
00:08:20.933 --> 00:08:22.833
- Now I get it.
- I see...

156
00:08:22.900 --> 00:08:27.433
Those thieves stole the hotel, too. That's why Weston's the front desk clerk.

157
00:08:30.666 --> 00:08:36.400
Rotom! I swear I'm not mad at you! Won't you please come back?

158
00:08:37.566 --> 00:08:39.433
Rotom...

159
00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:44.266
That's sad. You're upset because you couldn't say you're sorry to your partner.

160
00:08:44.333 --> 00:08:46.200
- Is that right?
- Pikachu.

161
00:08:46.266 --> 00:08:47.433
Rotom, Rotom!

162
00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:50.300
It must have been hard for you all this time.

163
00:08:50.366 --> 00:08:53.066
Hey, Clemont? Is there anything we can do?

164
00:08:53.133 --> 00:08:55.566
It's tricky. We can't change the past

165
00:08:55.633 --> 00:08:57.333
unless we have a time machine or something.

166
00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.833
Rotom?

167
00:09:00.333 --> 00:09:02.733
- Rotom! Rotom, Rotom!
- Huh?

168
00:09:02.800 --> 00:09:05.733
It looks like Rotom has some sort of idea.

169
00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:07.833
- Let's check it out!
- Pika, Pika!

170
00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:11.733
Rotom!

171
00:09:13.433 --> 00:09:16.033
- Huh...
- Rotom!

172
00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:18.733
- You want us to go in?
- Rotom.

173
00:09:18.800 --> 00:09:20.833
All right. Let's do it!

174
00:09:24.133 --> 00:09:25.566
Rotom!

175
00:09:25.633 --> 00:09:27.800
Huh?

176
00:09:27.866 --> 00:09:31.633
Rotom!

177
00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:33.933
Wait a second!

178
00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:36.733
Does this hotel really have ten basement floors?

179
00:09:36.800 --> 00:09:39.733
- Uh, I kind of think no.
- Pika?

180
00:09:39.800 --> 00:09:43.433
- I'm scared! This is so weird!
- This is gonna be awesome!

181
00:09:46.133 --> 00:09:48.066
-Pika!

182
00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:54.800
- This is so much fun!
- Since when?

183
00:09:54.866 --> 00:09:56.666
- Denne-ne!
- Pika!

184
00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.600
- What's this?
- Pika...

185
00:10:04.666 --> 00:10:06.833
The tenth basement floor?

186
00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.333
This is the ground floor!

187
00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:12.700
- Hey, Ash! Isn't that...
- Those crooks!

188
00:10:12.766 --> 00:10:15.433
Stealing Pokémon again. Come on!

189
00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:26.933
Check it out! What's going on?

190
00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.633
Who's that Pokémon?

191
00:10:34.000 --> 00:10:36.466
It's Rotom!

192
00:10:36.533 --> 00:10:38.333
Rotom!

193
00:10:40.866 --> 00:10:44.033
Or are you nothing but a little coward?

194
00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:44.933
What?

195
00:10:45.000 --> 00:10:46.933
Is this...

196
00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:50.733
So if I win, you'll leave my guests alone and go.

197
00:10:50.800 --> 00:10:53.666
- Is it a deal?
- Yeah. It's a deal.

198
00:10:53.733 --> 00:10:58.100
It's exactly like the scene from the past that Rotom showed us on TV.

199
00:10:58.166 --> 00:11:01.433
No way! Are you saying we went back in time?

200
00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:04.466
- Shh!
- That means we know what happens next.

201
00:11:04.533 --> 00:11:06.233
Krookodile, out here!

202
00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.200
- Krooko!
- Rotom!

203
00:11:11.266 --> 00:11:13.200
Dile!

204
00:11:14.266 --> 00:11:17.133
Rotom! Rotom! Where did you go?

205
00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.233
It flew away. Just like a little coward.

206
00:11:20.300 --> 00:11:23.400
-Looks like I win.

207
00:11:23.466 --> 00:11:25.066
It's a win by forfeit.

208
00:11:25.133 --> 00:11:26.233
Hold it right there!

209
00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:27.400
- Huh?
- Hm?

210
00:11:27.466 --> 00:11:30.600
Hey, you haven't even started your battle yet.

211
00:11:30.666 --> 00:11:32.666
There's no way you can win by a forfeit!

212
00:11:32.733 --> 00:11:33.900
Yeah! Ash is right!

213
00:11:33.966 --> 00:11:36.166
You just give us five minutes.

214
00:11:36.233 --> 00:11:39.400
We'll find Rotom and bring it back to have a battle with you!

215
00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:43.400
- That kid is right, isn't he?
- Huh?

216
00:11:43.466 --> 00:11:45.900
Yes. This doesn't count as a forfeit.

217
00:11:45.966 --> 00:11:49.633
- Let them have a proper battle!
- Yeah, he's right!

218
00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:52.100
You can't just claim victory like that!

219
00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:53.666
Yeah, OK, OK.

220
00:11:53.733 --> 00:11:58.666
So get Rotom back here right this minute! We'll try this again.

221
00:11:58.733 --> 00:12:02.000
- Come with us, please.
- Uh... Right!

222
00:12:05.733 --> 00:12:07.900
So, who are all of you?

223
00:12:07.966 --> 00:12:09.633
Don't worry about that.

224
00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:11.900
We just want you to listen to us, OK?

225
00:12:11.966 --> 00:12:14.900
Right. You see, we're all on your side.

226
00:12:14.966 --> 00:12:18.066
- What do you mean?
- Rotom? Rotom?

227
00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:22.100
You can come out now! This is your big chance to fix everything!

228
00:12:22.166 --> 00:12:23.966
You can apologise!

229
00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.966
- Rotom!
- Rotom...

230
00:12:29.033 --> 00:12:31.966
It's all right. I'm just glad you came back.

231
00:12:32.033 --> 00:12:34.833
Here's the thing. You've got to beat him!

232
00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:36.933
Your very future depends on it!

233
00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:40.366
- Do your best, Rotom!
- Rotom!

234
00:12:40.433 --> 00:12:44.966
I know I let my anger get the best of me and agreed to battle that man,

235
00:12:45.033 --> 00:12:46.866
but we have little experience.

236
00:12:46.933 --> 00:12:49.133
Rotom and I are going to lose for sure!

237
00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:51.466
- Rotom, Rotom!
- Don't worry.

238
00:12:51.533 --> 00:12:54.000
- You guys have all of us!
- Pika, pika!

239
00:12:54.066 --> 00:12:56.100
I'm sure we can come up with a plan.

240
00:12:56.166 --> 00:12:59.100
- Clemont will figure it out!
- Let's see.

241
00:12:59.166 --> 00:13:03.466
Mantle uses a Krookodile, a Ground and Dark type.

242
00:13:03.533 --> 00:13:06.700
Rotom's at a disadvantage as an Electric and Ghost type.

243
00:13:08.600 --> 00:13:11.066
Hm! Perfect!

244
00:13:11.133 --> 00:13:16.566
Rotom can use this! If my plan works, you should win easily!

245
00:13:16.633 --> 00:13:20.433
Time's almost up.

246
00:13:20.500 --> 00:13:23.666
He's so scared, he ran away.

247
00:13:23.733 --> 00:13:26.166
Huh?

248
00:13:26.233 --> 00:13:29.266
You came back! I thought you gave up.

249
00:13:29.333 --> 00:13:32.500
I'm here. But remember, if I win,

250
00:13:32.566 --> 00:13:36.366
you promise to never challenge people with shady demands!

251
00:13:36.433 --> 00:13:41.333
You got it. But remember, if I win, this hotel is mine!

252
00:13:41.400 --> 00:13:43.000
Agreed.

253
00:13:43.066 --> 00:13:45.500
- Weston!
- Hope he's OK.

254
00:13:45.566 --> 00:13:49.000
I know that he can win this! That is, if my plan goes well.

255
00:13:49.066 --> 00:13:52.000
- Rotom, you can do it!
- Pika, pika!

256
00:13:53.166 --> 00:13:57.000
Rotom versus Krookodile! A one-on-one battle!

257
00:13:57.066 --> 00:13:59.000
Battle, begin!

258
00:13:59.066 --> 00:14:01.733
Rotom, Electro Ball!

259
00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:04.366
Rotom!

260
00:14:05.433 --> 00:14:09.433
Electric-type moves won't work on my Krookodile.

261
00:14:11.566 --> 00:14:14.233
I think he's completely forgotten about the plan we made!

262
00:14:14.300 --> 00:14:16.800
- Try to relax, Weston!
- Pikachu!

263
00:14:16.866 --> 00:14:19.033
Aren't you forgetting something important?

264
00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:21.266
Huh? Oh. Yes, you're right.

265
00:14:21.333 --> 00:14:24.600
- Rotom! The socket!
- Rotom!

266
00:14:26.433 --> 00:14:29.366
Frightened again, are you? How pathetic!

267
00:14:29.433 --> 00:14:33.133
-Rotom!

268
00:14:37.433 --> 00:14:39.866
Time's running out.

269
00:14:39.933 --> 00:14:42.266
And it looks like the hotel's mine.

270
00:14:42.333 --> 00:14:43.666
-Huh?

271
00:14:43.733 --> 00:14:46.966
Huh?

272
00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:50.533
-Ro, to, to, to, to, to, tom!

273
00:14:50.600 --> 00:14:52.533
What's that?

274
00:14:52.600 --> 00:14:55.533
Don't forget! Wash Rotom can use Hydro Pump!

275
00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:59.400
- Use Hydro Pump!
- Rotom!

276
00:14:59.466 --> 00:15:03.266
Krookodile...

277
00:15:06.633 --> 00:15:08.000
Krooka!

278
00:15:08.066 --> 00:15:11.000
- Yes! That was a huge hit!
- Pika!

279
00:15:11.066 --> 00:15:13.500
You said this fight would be one-on-one!

280
00:15:13.566 --> 00:15:17.766
Even if it changes form, it's still Rotom. So this is a one-on-one!

281
00:15:17.833 --> 00:15:20.000
Why, you little...

282
00:15:20.066 --> 00:15:23.600
- Krookodile, use Hyper Beam!
- Krookodile!

283
00:15:25.666 --> 00:15:27.600
Rotom!

284
00:15:27.666 --> 00:15:28.533
Awesome!

285
00:15:28.600 --> 00:15:33.266
Despite the damage after a Water-type move, Krookodile is still able to attack!

286
00:15:33.333 --> 00:15:36.600
- Krookodile's strong.
- But will Rotom be OK?

287
00:15:36.666 --> 00:15:39.200
You ready? It's time to move to Plan B!

288
00:15:39.266 --> 00:15:42.500
Right. Rotom! The socket!

289
00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.333
Rotom!

290
00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.066
Rotom!

291
00:15:47.133 --> 00:15:51.300
- Rotom!

292
00:15:56.366 --> 00:16:00.200
- Uh... Uh...

293
00:16:00.266 --> 00:16:01.966
-Pika!

294
00:16:04.266 --> 00:16:05.900
Now it's a refrigerator?

295
00:16:07.333 --> 00:16:09.866
Remember, Frost Rotom can use Blizzard!

296
00:16:09.933 --> 00:16:12.300
Rotom, use Blizzard!

297
00:16:12.366 --> 00:16:13.700
Rotom!

298
00:16:15.766 --> 00:16:17.700
Krooka...

299
00:16:17.766 --> 00:16:19.800
Pull yourself together, Krookodile!

300
00:16:19.866 --> 00:16:21.533
- Rotom! Great stuff!
- Pika!

301
00:16:21.600 --> 00:16:24.533
Why, you... Now use Crunch!

302
00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.466
Krookodile!

303
00:16:27.533 --> 00:16:31.533
Kroo, kroo, kroo! Krooko, krooko, krooko, Dile!

304
00:16:33.533 --> 00:16:36.466
- Krookodile's tough!
- Pika!

305
00:16:36.533 --> 00:16:40.466
- Listen to me! Plan C is up next!
- Show him who's boss!

306
00:16:40.533 --> 00:16:44.766
- Rotom! Next form!
- Rotom! Rotom!

307
00:16:45.766 --> 00:16:48.300
-Wait! What's going on now?

308
00:16:48.366 --> 00:16:49.400
-Pika!

309
00:16:49.466 --> 00:16:52.866
Mow Rotom! Leaf Storm, let's go!

310
00:16:52.933 --> 00:16:54.333
Rotom!

311
00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.700
Krookodile...

312
00:17:00.433 --> 00:17:03.466
Krooka...

313
00:17:03.533 --> 00:17:05.200
Dile!

314
00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:07.366
Dile...

315
00:17:07.433 --> 00:17:09.366
You did it, Rotom!

316
00:17:09.433 --> 00:17:13.333
Krookodile is unable to battle! So Rotom wins!

317
00:17:13.400 --> 00:17:18.300
Fine. Krookodile, return!

318
00:17:18.366 --> 00:17:22.300
Which means the victor is Weston, the hotel owner!

319
00:17:22.366 --> 00:17:24.833
All right, you made a promise.

320
00:17:24.900 --> 00:17:27.033
From now on, no more shady challenges!

321
00:17:27.099 --> 00:17:30.900
Ha. Like I care. I'll just take it by force!

322
00:17:30.966 --> 00:17:32.266
Hey, fellas?

323
00:17:32.333 --> 00:17:35.366
That's our cue! -Yeah. Don't be cute.

324
00:17:35.433 --> 00:17:39.633
They had no intention of keeping their promise right from the very beginning!

325
00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:42.533
Maybe changing past events isn't even possible!

326
00:17:42.600 --> 00:17:44.633
- Oh, no!
- Ash, wait!

327
00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:48.733
All right, then! We'll protect your hotel together!

328
00:17:48.800 --> 00:17:51.400
- Really? All right!
- Pika.

329
00:17:51.466 --> 00:17:55.400
- Use Thunderbolt!
- Pikachu!

330
00:17:57.033 --> 00:17:59.866
- Pi!

331
00:18:00.866 --> 00:18:03.566
-Sorry. I was bad.

332
00:18:03.633 --> 00:18:05.433
I'll do whatever you say, OK?

333
00:18:11.500 --> 00:18:14.800
Don't forget. Take care of that Rotom.

334
00:18:14.866 --> 00:18:17.500
- What an amazing Pokémon!
- Pika, Pika!

335
00:18:17.566 --> 00:18:19.933
- Thanks so much!
- Rotom!

336
00:18:22.866 --> 00:18:26.433
Rotom!

337
00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.233
Ka?

338
00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:37.933
Hey, are we back in the present?

339
00:18:38.000 --> 00:18:39.400
- Huh?

340
00:18:41.633 --> 00:18:44.133
- Let's check it out.
- Right!

341
00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:49.666
- Huh? Hi, there. Excuse me.
- Welcome, dear guest.

342
00:18:49.733 --> 00:18:50.666
-Pika?

343
00:18:50.733 --> 00:18:54.166
Please allow me to open the door. Now step inside.

344
00:18:58.433 --> 00:19:01.400
- We bid you welcome!
- Wait a minute.

345
00:19:01.466 --> 00:19:03.566
- What are you three doing here?
- Huh?

346
00:19:03.633 --> 00:19:07.833
I've been working at this hotel for over ten years now, since it opened.

347
00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.466
Back then, I was a horrible crook,

348
00:19:10.533 --> 00:19:14.333
but then the kindly hotel owner graciously gave me a job!

349
00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:16.166
-He gave you a job?

350
00:19:16.233 --> 00:19:17.600
Hm?

351
00:19:17.666 --> 00:19:20.700
Now, ladies and gentlemen... Greetings!

352
00:19:20.766 --> 00:19:25.966
I welcome you to the celebration of our hotel's glorious tenth anniversary!

353
00:19:26.033 --> 00:19:28.600
Thank you for attending.

354
00:19:28.666 --> 00:19:32.033
Rotom?

355
00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.866
- Rot! Rotom!
- Pika?

356
00:19:34.933 --> 00:19:37.766
- Rotom!
- Rotom! Rotom!

357
00:19:37.833 --> 00:19:39.766
- Huh?
- What do you think?

358
00:19:39.833 --> 00:19:43.633
My name is Weston, the owner. A pleasure!

359
00:19:45.333 --> 00:19:48.266
- You're doing great!
- Pangoro!

360
00:19:48.333 --> 00:19:52.766
There's only one reason I stand before you today as the hotel owner.

361
00:19:52.833 --> 00:19:57.800
It was a boy, his Pikachu, and his friends, who appeared out of nowhere

362
00:19:57.866 --> 00:20:00.533
and then left without saying their names.

363
00:20:00.600 --> 00:20:02.700
And all on our opening day.

364
00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:07.966
It sure looks different than before!

365
00:20:08.033 --> 00:20:11.366
- So pretty!
- Rot! Rotom!

366
00:20:11.433 --> 00:20:12.733
What's up, Rotom?

367
00:20:12.800 --> 00:20:14.466
- No way!
- Pika!

368
00:20:18.533 --> 00:20:21.466
- It's us!
- Wow. Amazing!

369
00:20:21.533 --> 00:20:23.466
So it wasn't a dream.

370
00:20:23.533 --> 00:20:27.400
Pikachu, we really did travel back in time!

371
00:20:27.466 --> 00:20:28.966
-Pikachu!

372
00:20:29.033 --> 00:20:31.333
Our heroes' journey back in time

373
00:20:31.400 --> 00:20:35.833
has changed this hotel's past into a much brighter present.

374
00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.600
Now, what adventures await them in their future?

375
00:20:38.666 --> 00:20:42.266
Time will tell, as the journey continues!

376
00:20:43.933 --> 00:20:46.300
Rotom!
